`[USER MESSAGE]` — a mid-task message injected while you were already working. Treat as a course-correction or additional requirement. Integrate immediately.
`[EXECUTION RESULT]` — output from your previous control block: tool returns, stdout, errors. Ground truth of what happened. Read carefully before every step.

